      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; color: #0369a1; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        2. Structured Data Schemas (JSON-LD)
      </h2>
      <p style="color: #64748b; font-style: italic;">No schemas added.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; color: #0369a1; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        3. Content (Rich Text — Copy &amp; Paste Directly into Blog Editor)
      </h2>
      <div class="blog-rich-content" style="border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 18px; background-color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #0f172a;">
        <p>Hey,&nbsp;did&nbsp;you&nbsp;just&nbsp;complete&nbsp;your&nbsp;12th&nbsp;grade&nbsp;in&nbsp;science?&nbsp;And&nbsp;now&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;asking&nbsp;yourself,&nbsp;“What&nbsp;should&nbsp;be&nbsp;my&nbsp;next&nbsp;move?”&nbsp;You&nbsp;have&nbsp;probably&nbsp;heard&nbsp;people&nbsp;talking&nbsp;about&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;—how&nbsp;it&nbsp;is&nbsp;among&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;sought-after&nbsp;professions&nbsp;at&nbsp;present.</p><p>Well,&nbsp;let&nbsp;me&nbsp;tell&nbsp;you,&nbsp;you’re&nbsp;thinking&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;right&nbsp;direction.&nbsp;Data&nbsp;science&nbsp;is&nbsp;not&nbsp;just&nbsp;a&nbsp;fancy&nbsp;word.&nbsp;It’s&nbsp;a&nbsp;field&nbsp;where&nbsp;you&nbsp;<strong>play&nbsp;with&nbsp;data</strong>,&nbsp;understand&nbsp;it,&nbsp;and&nbsp;use&nbsp;it&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;smart&nbsp;decisions.</p><p>If&nbsp;you&nbsp;already&nbsp;love&nbsp;tech&nbsp;or&nbsp;have&nbsp;a&nbsp;little&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;about&nbsp;things&nbsp;like&nbsp;<strong>vulnerability&nbsp;assessment&nbsp;and&nbsp;penetration&nbsp;testing&nbsp;(VAPT)</strong>,&nbsp;then&nbsp;you’ll&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;too.&nbsp;Both&nbsp;fields&nbsp;need&nbsp;curiosity,&nbsp;logic,&nbsp;and&nbsp;problem-solving&nbsp;skills.&nbsp;Let’s&nbsp;go&nbsp;step&nbsp;by&nbsp;step&nbsp;and&nbsp;see&nbsp;<strong>how&nbsp;to&nbsp;start&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;science,</strong>&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;simple&nbsp;way.</p><h2><strong>What&nbsp;Is&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science?</strong></h2><p>We&nbsp;all&nbsp;come&nbsp;across&nbsp;many&nbsp;forms&nbsp;of&nbsp;data&nbsp;in&nbsp;our&nbsp;daily&nbsp;lives,&nbsp;like&nbsp;numbers,&nbsp;photos,&nbsp;videos,&nbsp;names,&nbsp;and&nbsp;so&nbsp;on.&nbsp;All&nbsp;this&nbsp;information&nbsp;together&nbsp;we&nbsp;call&nbsp;data.&nbsp;The&nbsp;process&nbsp;of&nbsp;collecting,&nbsp;analyzing,&nbsp;and&nbsp;interpreting&nbsp;large&nbsp;amounts&nbsp;of&nbsp;information&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;use&nbsp;of&nbsp;it&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;firm&nbsp;or&nbsp;company&nbsp;is&nbsp;what&nbsp;we&nbsp;call&nbsp;data&nbsp;science.&nbsp;</p><p>And&nbsp;the&nbsp;role&nbsp;of&nbsp;a&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientist&nbsp;is&nbsp;to&nbsp;study&nbsp;this&nbsp;data&nbsp;and&nbsp;understand&nbsp;the&nbsp;patterns&nbsp;to&nbsp;find&nbsp;out&nbsp;the&nbsp;actual&nbsp;meaning&nbsp;of&nbsp;it.&nbsp;And&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;help&nbsp;of&nbsp;tools&nbsp;from&nbsp;mathematics,&nbsp;statistics,&nbsp;and&nbsp;computer&nbsp;science,&nbsp;they&nbsp;deliver&nbsp;useful&nbsp;insights&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;raw&nbsp;data&nbsp;to&nbsp;help&nbsp;businesses&nbsp;and&nbsp;organizations&nbsp;make&nbsp;better&nbsp;decisions.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Here’s&nbsp;an&nbsp;example:</strong></p><ul><li>When&nbsp;Netflix&nbsp;suggests&nbsp;a&nbsp;movie&nbsp;you&nbsp;might&nbsp;like&nbsp;—&nbsp;that’s&nbsp;data&nbsp;science.</li><li>When&nbsp;Amazon&nbsp;shows&nbsp;you&nbsp;a&nbsp;product&nbsp;similar&nbsp;to&nbsp;what&nbsp;you&nbsp;searched&nbsp;—&nbsp;that’s&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;again.</li><li>Even&nbsp;when&nbsp;a&nbsp;bank&nbsp;detects&nbsp;fake&nbsp;transactions&nbsp;—&nbsp;that’s&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;helping&nbsp;them.&nbsp;</li></ul><p>So,&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;is&nbsp;simply&nbsp;about&nbsp;<strong>using&nbsp;data&nbsp;to&nbsp;solve&nbsp;problems</strong>.</p><h2><strong>Why&nbsp;Choose&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th&nbsp;Science?</strong></h2><p>If&nbsp;you&nbsp;studied&nbsp;<strong>Math,&nbsp;Physics,&nbsp;or&nbsp;Computer&nbsp;Science</strong>,&nbsp;you&nbsp;already&nbsp;have&nbsp;an&nbsp;edge.&nbsp;You&nbsp;know&nbsp;how&nbsp;to&nbsp;think&nbsp;logically&nbsp;and&nbsp;solve&nbsp;problems&nbsp;—&nbsp;and&nbsp;that’s&nbsp;exactly&nbsp;what&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;is&nbsp;about.</p><ul><li>Every&nbsp;company&nbsp;needs&nbsp;data&nbsp;experts.</li><li>Data&nbsp;science&nbsp;pays&nbsp;well&nbsp;—&nbsp;even&nbsp;freshers&nbsp;earn&nbsp;decent&nbsp;salaries.</li><li>You&nbsp;can&nbsp;work&nbsp;in&nbsp;any&nbsp;industry&nbsp;—&nbsp;tech,&nbsp;health,&nbsp;banking,&nbsp;or&nbsp;even&nbsp;sports.</li><li>It&nbsp;connects&nbsp;beautifully&nbsp;with&nbsp;cybersecurity&nbsp;and&nbsp;system&nbsp;testing&nbsp;fields.</li></ul><h2><strong>How&nbsp;Can&nbsp;a&nbsp;Beginner&nbsp;Start&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science?</strong></h2><p>So,&nbsp;any&nbsp;person&nbsp;you&nbsp;see&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;successful&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientist&nbsp;was&nbsp;once&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;place&nbsp;where&nbsp;you&nbsp;are,&nbsp;with&nbsp;zero&nbsp;experience,&nbsp;no&nbsp;idea,&nbsp;but&nbsp;just&nbsp;curiosity&nbsp;and&nbsp;willingness&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>1.&nbsp;Understand&nbsp;What&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Actually&nbsp;Is</strong>&nbsp;—&nbsp;Before&nbsp;delving&nbsp;into&nbsp;tools&nbsp;and&nbsp;tech,&nbsp;first&nbsp;try&nbsp;to&nbsp;understand&nbsp;what&nbsp;data&nbsp;is&nbsp;in&nbsp;actuality,&nbsp;and&nbsp;why&nbsp;the&nbsp;data&nbsp;is&nbsp;considered&nbsp;the&nbsp;king.&nbsp;Your&nbsp;curiosity&nbsp;should&nbsp;be&nbsp;the&nbsp;first&nbsp;skill&nbsp;of&nbsp;yours&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;a&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;this&nbsp;journey.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>2.&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;Python&nbsp;—&nbsp;</strong>Python&nbsp;isn’t&nbsp;just&nbsp;a&nbsp;programming&nbsp;language;&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;contrary,&nbsp;it&nbsp;is&nbsp;considered&nbsp;the&nbsp;backbone&nbsp;of&nbsp;data&nbsp;science,&nbsp;machine&nbsp;learning,&nbsp;and&nbsp;AI.&nbsp;And&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;part&nbsp;about&nbsp;this&nbsp;language&nbsp;is&nbsp;that&nbsp;it&nbsp;is&nbsp;totally&nbsp;beginner-friendly.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>3.&nbsp;Get&nbsp;Comfortable&nbsp;With&nbsp;Basic&nbsp;Math&nbsp;and&nbsp;Statistics&nbsp;</strong>—&nbsp;Well,&nbsp;to&nbsp;become&nbsp;a&nbsp;data&nbsp;scientist,&nbsp;you&nbsp;don’t&nbsp;need&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;very&nbsp;advanced&nbsp;in&nbsp;math;&nbsp;the&nbsp;basic&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;of&nbsp;averages,&nbsp;probability,&nbsp;percentages,&nbsp;and&nbsp;graphs&nbsp;is&nbsp;enough.&nbsp;Statistics&nbsp;is&nbsp;simply&nbsp;about&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;what&nbsp;the&nbsp;data&nbsp;is&nbsp;telling&nbsp;you.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>4.&nbsp;Start&nbsp;Visualising&nbsp;Data</strong>&nbsp;—&nbsp;Numbers&nbsp;alone&nbsp;are&nbsp;no&nbsp;more&nbsp;of&nbsp;use&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;don’t&nbsp;know&nbsp;how&nbsp;to&nbsp;communicate&nbsp;with&nbsp;them&nbsp;effectively.&nbsp;For&nbsp;this,&nbsp;you&nbsp;must&nbsp;know&nbsp;how&nbsp;to&nbsp;use&nbsp;tools&nbsp;like&nbsp;Power&nbsp;BI,&nbsp;Tableau,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Excel&nbsp;as&nbsp;well.&nbsp;These&nbsp;tools&nbsp;turn&nbsp;raw&nbsp;data&nbsp;into&nbsp;visuals&nbsp;that&nbsp;companies&nbsp;actually&nbsp;make&nbsp;decisions&nbsp;from.</p><p><strong>5.&nbsp;Take&nbsp;a&nbsp;Structured&nbsp;Course&nbsp;—&nbsp;Don&#39;t&nbsp;Just&nbsp;Rely&nbsp;on&nbsp;YouTube</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Learning&nbsp;from&nbsp;YouTube&nbsp;may&nbsp;leave&nbsp;you&nbsp;with&nbsp;lots&nbsp;of&nbsp;confusion&nbsp;and&nbsp;no&nbsp;clear&nbsp;path.&nbsp;But&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;really&nbsp;concerned&nbsp;about&nbsp;your&nbsp;learning&nbsp;and&nbsp;for&nbsp;this&nbsp;particular&nbsp;skill,&nbsp;then&nbsp;you&nbsp;must&nbsp;go&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;structured&nbsp;course&nbsp;from&nbsp;a&nbsp;recognised&nbsp;institute,&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;of&nbsp;your&nbsp;investments.&nbsp;</p><p>NIDADS&nbsp;(National&nbsp;Institute&nbsp;on&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;and&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science)&nbsp;offers&nbsp;a&nbsp;diploma&nbsp;and&nbsp;certification&nbsp;program&nbsp;in&nbsp;both&nbsp;data&nbsp;analytics&nbsp;and&nbsp;data&nbsp;science.&nbsp;Here,&nbsp;you&nbsp;will&nbsp;get&nbsp;hands-on&nbsp;experience&nbsp;through&nbsp;real-world&nbsp;projects&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;structured&nbsp;path&nbsp;for&nbsp;learning&nbsp;that&nbsp;ends&nbsp;with&nbsp;your&nbsp;employment.&nbsp;</p><p>So,&nbsp;if&nbsp;you’re&nbsp;serious&nbsp;about&nbsp;building&nbsp;a&nbsp;career&nbsp;in&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science,&nbsp;AI,&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning,&nbsp;or&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics,&nbsp;then&nbsp;choosing&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;could&nbsp;be&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;decision&nbsp;of&nbsp;your&nbsp;career.&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Diploma&nbsp;in&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;After&nbsp;12th</strong></h2><p>A&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://www.nidads.com/course/diploma-in-data-science-and-ai" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Diploma&nbsp;in&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science</a></strong>&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;short-term&nbsp;course&nbsp;that&nbsp;helps&nbsp;you&nbsp;learn&nbsp;all&nbsp;the&nbsp;basics&nbsp;quickly.</p><ul><li>Python&nbsp;programming</li><li>Data&nbsp;analysis&nbsp;and&nbsp;visualization</li><li>Machine&nbsp;learning&nbsp;basics</li><li>Database&nbsp;handling</li><li>Real-world&nbsp;projects</li></ul><p>The&nbsp;<strong>duration</strong>&nbsp;is&nbsp;usually&nbsp;<strong>6&nbsp;months&nbsp;to&nbsp;2&nbsp;years</strong>,&nbsp;depending&nbsp;on&nbsp;where&nbsp;you&nbsp;study.</p><p><strong>Career&nbsp;Options&nbsp;and&nbsp;Salary</strong></p><p>Data&nbsp;science&nbsp;courses&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;science&nbsp;offer&nbsp;many&nbsp;job&nbsp;roles&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;choose&nbsp;from:</p><ul><li><strong>Data&nbsp;Analyst:</strong>&nbsp;Studies&nbsp;data&nbsp;and&nbsp;explains&nbsp;what&nbsp;it&nbsp;means.</li><li></li><li><strong>Data&nbsp;Scientist:</strong>&nbsp;Uses&nbsp;data&nbsp;and&nbsp;AI&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;predictions.</li><li></li><li><strong>Machine&nbsp;Learning&nbsp;Engineer:</strong>&nbsp;Builds&nbsp;smart&nbsp;programs&nbsp;that&nbsp;learn&nbsp;automatically.</li><li></li><li><strong>Cyber&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analyst:</strong>&nbsp;Uses&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;in&nbsp;security&nbsp;and&nbsp;threat&nbsp;detection.</li><li></li></ul><p><strong>Salary&nbsp;in&nbsp;India:</strong></p><ul><li>Beginners:&nbsp;₹5–8&nbsp;LPA</li><li></li><li>Experienced&nbsp;professionals:&nbsp;₹10–20&nbsp;LPA&nbsp;or&nbsp;more</li></ul><p>The&nbsp;more&nbsp;projects&nbsp;and&nbsp;practical&nbsp;experience&nbsp;you&nbsp;have,&nbsp;the&nbsp;faster&nbsp;you’ll&nbsp;grow.&nbsp;<a href="https://www.nidads.com/blog/python-and-data-science-jobs-in-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">python&nbsp;and&nbsp;data&nbsp;science</a></p><h2><strong>Important&nbsp;Skills&nbsp;to&nbsp;Learn</strong></h2><p>Here&nbsp;are&nbsp;the&nbsp;key&nbsp;skills&nbsp;that&nbsp;will&nbsp;help&nbsp;you&nbsp;shine:</p><ul><li><strong>Python</strong>&nbsp;–&nbsp;for&nbsp;data&nbsp;and&nbsp;automation</li><li></li><li><strong>SQL</strong>&nbsp;–&nbsp;for&nbsp;managing&nbsp;databases</li><li></li><li><strong>Math&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Statistics</strong>&nbsp;–&nbsp;for&nbsp;analysis</li><li></li><li><strong>Visualization&nbsp;Tools</strong>&nbsp;–&nbsp;to&nbsp;show&nbsp;results&nbsp;clearly</li><li></li><li><strong>Machine&nbsp;Learning</strong>&nbsp;–&nbsp;to&nbsp;build&nbsp;smart&nbsp;systems</li><li></li><li><strong>Communication</strong>&nbsp;–&nbsp;to&nbsp;explain&nbsp;your&nbsp;findings&nbsp;simply</li></ul><h2><strong>FAQs</strong></h2><h3><strong>1.&nbsp;Can&nbsp;I&nbsp;pursue&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;right&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;science?</strong></h3><p>Anyone&nbsp;who&nbsp;has&nbsp;completed&nbsp;their&nbsp;12th&nbsp;can&nbsp;go&nbsp;for&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;course.&nbsp;And&nbsp;for&nbsp;science&nbsp;stream&nbsp;students,&nbsp;there&nbsp;are&nbsp;plenty&nbsp;of&nbsp;options&nbsp;to&nbsp;enter&nbsp;this&nbsp;field,&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;B.Tech,&nbsp;BSc,&nbsp;or&nbsp;BCA.&nbsp;But&nbsp;for&nbsp;those&nbsp;who&nbsp;don’t&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;invest&nbsp;that&nbsp;much&nbsp;time&nbsp;and&nbsp;money&nbsp;in&nbsp;traditional&nbsp;degrees,&nbsp;they&nbsp;can&nbsp;opt&nbsp;for&nbsp;structured&nbsp;courses&nbsp;from&nbsp;well-known&nbsp;institutes&nbsp;like&nbsp;NIDADS.</p><h3><strong>2.&nbsp;Which&nbsp;subjects&nbsp;are&nbsp;important&nbsp;for&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th?</strong></h3><p>You&nbsp;should&nbsp;be&nbsp;good&nbsp;at&nbsp;mathematics,&nbsp;particularly&nbsp;in&nbsp;statistics,&nbsp;basic&nbsp;programming&nbsp;and&nbsp;logical&nbsp;reasoning&nbsp;are&nbsp;key.&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>3.&nbsp;Do&nbsp;I&nbsp;need&nbsp;coding&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;to&nbsp;start&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science?</strong></h3><p>Well,&nbsp;you&nbsp;will&nbsp;need&nbsp;a&nbsp;little&nbsp;bit&nbsp;of&nbsp;coding&nbsp;to&nbsp;grasp&nbsp;the&nbsp;full&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;of&nbsp;data&nbsp;science,&nbsp;but&nbsp;don’t&nbsp;worry.&nbsp;Because&nbsp;when&nbsp;you&nbsp;opt&nbsp;for&nbsp;a&nbsp;course&nbsp;that&nbsp;is&nbsp;specially&nbsp;built&nbsp;for&nbsp;complete&nbsp;beginners,&nbsp;it&nbsp;will&nbsp;take&nbsp;you&nbsp;through&nbsp;a&nbsp;basic&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;of&nbsp;coding&nbsp;and&nbsp;then&nbsp;cover&nbsp;the&nbsp;remaining&nbsp;course.&nbsp;And&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;example&nbsp;of&nbsp;this&nbsp;is&nbsp;NIDADS.&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>4.&nbsp;What&nbsp;are&nbsp;the&nbsp;best&nbsp;courses&nbsp;to&nbsp;choose&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;for&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science?</strong></h3><p>The&nbsp;best&nbsp;suits&nbsp;according&nbsp;to&nbsp;your&nbsp;need,&nbsp;like&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;want&nbsp;to&nbsp;dedicate&nbsp;your&nbsp;3-4&nbsp;years&nbsp;in&nbsp;education,&nbsp;then&nbsp;go&nbsp;for&nbsp;BSc&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science,&nbsp;B.Tech&nbsp;in&nbsp;AI/Data&nbsp;Science,&nbsp;or&nbsp;BCA.&nbsp;But&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;want&nbsp;early&nbsp;entry&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;workforce&nbsp;with&nbsp;better&nbsp;practical&nbsp;exposure,&nbsp;then&nbsp;go&nbsp;for&nbsp;short-term&nbsp;certifications.&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>5.&nbsp;How&nbsp;long&nbsp;does&nbsp;it&nbsp;take&nbsp;to&nbsp;become&nbsp;job-ready&nbsp;in&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science?</strong></h3><p>It&nbsp;depends&nbsp;on&nbsp;your&nbsp;skills&nbsp;and&nbsp;learning&nbsp;pace.&nbsp;But&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;right&nbsp;approach,&nbsp;consistency,&nbsp;and&nbsp;hands-on&nbsp;practice,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;make&nbsp;it&nbsp;big&nbsp;and&nbsp;sooner.&nbsp;</p><h2>Conclusion</h2><p>Starting&nbsp;a&nbsp;career&nbsp;in&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;after&nbsp;12th&nbsp;science&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;a&nbsp;smart&nbsp;choice&nbsp;for&nbsp;students&nbsp;who&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;technology,&nbsp;mathematics,&nbsp;and&nbsp;problem-solving.&nbsp;Whether&nbsp;you&nbsp;choose&nbsp;a&nbsp;degree&nbsp;or&nbsp;a&nbsp;structured&nbsp;certification,&nbsp;focus&nbsp;on&nbsp;Python,&nbsp;SQL,&nbsp;statistics,&nbsp;data&nbsp;visualization,&nbsp;machine&nbsp;learning,&nbsp;and&nbsp;real-world&nbsp;projects.&nbsp;With&nbsp;consistent&nbsp;learning,&nbsp;practical&nbsp;experience,&nbsp;<a href="https://indiaai.gov.in/article/top-5-online-courses-on-data-science?utm_source=chatgpt.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">data&nbsp;science&nbsp;courses&nbsp;and&nbsp;learning&nbsp;opportunities</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;right&nbsp;guidance,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;build&nbsp;strong&nbsp;skills&nbsp;and&nbsp;move&nbsp;confidently&nbsp;toward&nbsp;a&nbsp;rewarding&nbsp;career&nbsp;in&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;and&nbsp;AI.</p><h2>About&nbsp;the&nbsp;Author</h2><p>Quick&nbsp;facts</p><p><strong>Name:</strong>&nbsp;Shagun</p><p><strong>From:</strong>&nbsp;Delhi</p><p><strong>Education:</strong>&nbsp;B.Tech</p><p><strong>Program:</strong>&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;and&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics</p><p><strong>Placed&nbsp;in:</strong>&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;(National&nbsp;Institute&nbsp;of&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science)</p><p><strong>Covers&nbsp;topics:</strong>&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science,&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics,&nbsp;Artificial&nbsp;Intelligence,&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning,&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Engineering,&nbsp;Deep&nbsp;Learning</p><p><strong>Currently&nbsp;working&nbsp;as:&nbsp;</strong>Senior&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;Trainer</p><p><strong>In&nbsp;her&nbsp;words</strong>:&nbsp;&quot;The&nbsp;best&nbsp;way&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;isn&#39;t&nbsp;just&nbsp;solving&nbsp;problems&nbsp;—&nbsp;it&#39;s&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;why&nbsp;the&nbsp;solution&nbsp;works.&nbsp;That&#39;s&nbsp;what&nbsp;I&nbsp;try&nbsp;to&nbsp;teach&nbsp;every&nbsp;single&nbsp;day.&quot;</p>
      </div>
